# Headshot Images
# 
# Place leadership headshot images here with the following naming convention:
# - Convert name to lowercase
# - Replace spaces with hyphens
# - Use .jpg extension
#
# Examples:
# - Thomas Carrie → thomas-carrie.jpg
# - Ciaran Henning → ciaran-henning.jpg
# - Jordan Raftis → jordan-raftis.jpg
# - Evan Wansbrough → evan-wansbrough.jpg
# - Evan Kischer → evan-kischer.jpg
# - Jamie Taylor → jamie-taylor.jpg
# - Avery Martin → avery-martin.jpg
# - Nolan Carson → nolan-carson.jpg
# - Claire Mount → claire-mount.jpg
# - Ella Hoffman → ella-hoffman.jpg
# - Brendan Deeves → brendan-deeves.jpg
#
# Recommended image size: 400x400px or larger (square format)
# Images will be automatically cropped to circular format

